	(text "Revision A    Date 2026-11-26    Doc No RR-EL-0103\n\nDetector-head acquisition board: eight SiPM front ends in four identical lanes (floor + reference channel:\npreamp, fast/slow shaping, comparators, event latches), programmable 0-62.5 V bias with per-channel trim,\nfour DACs, STM32G474VET6, isolated RS-485, heater switch, input protection and low-noise rails.\nNetlist: design/circuit.py (stage 1) + overrides.py (stage 2: S2-xx, see STAGE2_CHANGE_REQUESTS.md).\nLanes: sheets LANEk_FLOOR / LANEk_REF / LANEk_LOGIC are identical for k = 0..3 (renamed nets only).\n\nLayers: 6    Thickness: 1.60 mm\nRails: +3V3, +3V3A, +3V3_EVT, +5V6, +5V_A, BUS_GND, FRAME, GND\n\nThis schematic is generated from board.py by tools/eda (rrkicad).\nAll nets are connected by name (global labels / power symbols); there are no drawn wires between symbols."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 20 29 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.8 1.8)
			)
